CTLSPEC AG (proto_state = PowerDelivery & PayloadType = ScheduleRenegotiationPayloadID & EVSEProcessing = NOT_APPLICABLE & ResponseCode = OK & EVProcessing = Ongoing & ChargeProgress = Stop & ChargeProgress = Standby -> AX proto_state = PowerDelivery)

-- T20: When guards hold at PowerDelivery, transition to AC_ChargeLoop
-- Source: V2G20-2193, V2G20-1969, V2G20-2192
CTLSPEC AG (proto_state = PowerDelivery & PayloadType = ScheduleRenegotiationPayloadID & EVSEProcessing = NOT_APPLICABLE & ResponseCode = OK & EVProcessing = Ongoing & ChargeProgress = Stop & ChargeProgress = Standby -> AX proto_state = AC_ChargeLoop)

